// The Appeal, ch2: What They Had to Believe. Thursday, November 26 to Thursday, December 10, 2026.
// Coverage per the bible: scenes LR04x4 LR05x3 LR02 RC05x2 RC06 RC07; quiz LR04x4 LR05x4 LR01 LR02 LR06x2 RC05x2 RC06x2 RC07 RC01.
// Full-length passage (p2): the Neptune and Vulcan predictions (Le Verrier 1846 and 1859, Galle at Berlin, Mercury's perihelion, general relativity 1915), history of science, written fresh.
// Weekdays computed 2026-10-16: Thanksgiving Thursday, November 26, 2026; Tuesday, December 1; Thursday, December 3; Saturday, December 5; Wednesday, December 9; Thursday, December 10. Saturday, October 27, 2007 and Sunday, October 28, 2007.
// Phil Abrams's file note ("Client says no stops. Ask again re daughter.") is planted here without comment, per the reveal schedule; it pays off in ch12.
